      "content": "but you dont get it. it's not just being lonely. it's like the world just... moved on without me. i look at my phone and there's nothing. i look at my old groups and it's like i'm looking at a life i'm not even part of anymore. it’s like i’ve already been deleted. how am i supposed to \"find connection\" when the version of me that people actually liked is just... gone? i'm just a shell.",
